assertion  ST.uses.001
says       When an assertion's own prerequisite PASSes, its test runs.
uses       ST.sh.001
test       t/001-pass.c
expect     PASS

assertion  ST.uses.002
says       When an assertion's own prerequisite FAILs, it is UNRESOLVED
           without running.
uses       ST.sh.002
test       t/002-pass.c
expect     UNRESOLVED
